LLMs evaluation
We evaluated the performance of seven prominent Arabic language models using our newly curated Arabic benchmarks, GATmath and GATLc. The models assessed are jais-13b-chat, jais-30b-chat [
24
], AceGPT-13B-chat [
23
], LLaMA3-70b-instruct model [
79
], ALLaM-13B, ALLaM-SFT-70B [
53
], and Qwen2-72B-Instruct [
82
]. The evaluation metric that we use is accuracy, as shown in the following equation:
